        Long_Term_Stay[Long-Term US Stay Feasible & Secured For Both]
        
        Academia_Job --> Cap_Exempt
        Cap_Exempt --> Long_Term_Stay
    end

    Maintain_Ind --> Academia_Job
    Work_Restriction --> Academia_Job
